{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13173","headline":"泊丹阳与诸人同舟至马林溪遇雨 · 皇甫冉","name":"泊丹阳与诸人同舟至马林溪遇雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云林不可望，溪水更悠悠。\n共载人皆客，离家春是秋。\n远山方对枕，细雨莫回舟。\n来往南徐路，多爲芳草留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}